    <briefdescription>
<para>One node in the Hierarchical Tucker binary tree. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Leaf node</bold> (is_leaf == true):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Stores basis matrix U ∈ ℝ^{n_k × rank} (row-major: U[i,α] = U[i*rank+α]).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_h_t_node_1a066ca5c8ba4ddc5ea2871d671c34434b" kindref="member">rank</ref></computeroutput> is the output rank this leaf contributes to its parent.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><bold>Internal node</bold> (is_leaf == false):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Stores transfer tensor B ∈ ℝ^{r_left × r_right × rank} (row-major: B[l,r,α] = B[l*r_right*rank + r*rank + α]).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_h_t_node_1a6b35c5420f3f12bb8abdfedab4885404" kindref="member">r_left</ref></computeroutput> = rank of the left child&apos;s output.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_h_t_node_1af47877f4ac901d5e18040d7cf85cfe90" kindref="member">r_right</ref></computeroutput> = rank of the right child&apos;s output.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_h_t_node_1a066ca5c8ba4ddc5ea2871d671c34434b" kindref="member">rank</ref></computeroutput> = output rank of this node (1 at the root). </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
